# Git workflow

Pick the path that matches **how this task is running**:

| Context | Doc |
|---------|-----|
| Interactive Cursor (user at keyboard) | [docs/MANUAL_DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md](../../docs/MANUAL_DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md) |
| Cursor Cloud Agent or Linear-delegated | [docs/CLOUD_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md](../../docs/CLOUD_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md) |

**Manual:** no branch, commit, push, or PR unless the user **explicitly** asks.

**Cloud / Linear:** branch per task, commit, push, open PR, never merge automatically — details in the cloud workflow doc.

If mode is unclear, assume **manual** (no git actions) unless the user or task description clearly indicates Cloud Agent / Linear delegation.

Engineering quality and validation apply in both cases; see [engineering-quality.mdc](engineering-quality.mdc) and [testing.mdc](testing.mdc).
